\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Opinion distributions at stationarity under uniform (left) and bimodal (right) coupling. The bimodal $P(\alpha )$ produces three distinct clusters with stratification index $\mathcal  {S}\approx 0.27$, while the uniform distribution collapses to $K=1$. Dashed vertical lines mark cluster centroids; the UA position $x_{\mathrm  {UA}}=0.8$ is indicated by the red arrow.}}{13}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:heterogeneous}{{4}{13}{Opinion distributions at stationarity under uniform (left) and bimodal (right) coupling. The bimodal $P(\alpha )$ produces three distinct clusters with stratification index $\mathcal {S}\approx 0.27$, while the uniform distribution collapses to $K=1$. Dashed vertical lines mark cluster centroids; the UA position $\xUA =0.8$ is indicated by the red arrow}{figure.4}{}}
